(text "CABLE (rev 0.2, PCB): straight-through 4-wire JST-PH, J4 pin n -> J3 pin n\n  1: +5V_ESP -> +5V_CABLE   2: GND -> GND_HUD   3: LINK_ESP_TX -> HUD_RX (XIAO D7)   4: LINK_RP_TX <- HUD_TX (XIAO D6)\n  Goggle-side nets are renamed (GND_HUD, HUD_RX/TX) so each PCB is DRC-clean on its own; the cable joins them.\n  JP1: bridge to run the XIAO from jacket 5V. Leave OPEN while the XIAO also has its own USB plugged in." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6155368a-92b5-422c-9da0-28a17d61d3ac"))
